dil ki nazrou'n ne sada gham ke andhere dekhe<br>
baade akber na kabhi maa ne ujaale dekhe<br>
<br>
ya ali kehke nikali jo sina'n seene se <br>
sheh ki nazrou'n ne rawaa'n khoon ke dhaare dekhe<br>
<br>
umme laila ho ke sarwar ho gham e akber me <br>
dard ke arsh pe zakhmou'n ke sitare dekhe<br>
<br>
dekh sakte na the jis aankh me aansu wohi aaj <br>
bas khuda jaane sina seene me kaise dekhe<br>
<br>
jab chale laash e jawa'n leke hussain ibne ali <br>
apne armaan ke har ghaam pa laashe dekhe<br>
<br>
ran me shabbir ye kehte the tadap kar mere laal <br>
koi hum dum nahi jo zakhm hamaare dekhe<br>
<br>
laash akber ki utha kar badi hasrat se fida <br>
soo-e-dariya shahe mazloom tadapke dekhe<br>
